{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4b234e0810774c90cd2c3c0f4788975757a2cfce84bf595f01f8a7fc637e891c","ja":"みなさん、お疲れさまでした。\nイベントステージも握手会も、盛り上がりましたね♪","zh":"大家辛苦了。\n活动舞台和握手会都办得非常热闹呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"77e8968a411ab41ab82a1a979a29821c6d893270bae2970b0c1553519acbbd21","ja":"う、うん……♪　私たちのステージを見てくれた人が\nたくさんいて……すごく、うれしかったな……♪","zh":"嗯、嗯……♪　有好多人来看了\n我们的舞台演出……真的、好开心啊……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d5610cd6c1493af3506ae1a10a5948b721f81055c0571bcf6df1f1283f8aba36","ja":"劇のお話してくれた人、いっぱいいたね。\nミキのスタークスも大人気なの♪","zh":"聊起舞台剧的人，有好多呢。\n美希演的斯塔克斯也大受欢迎哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a7b05f01995287d73dd0fb040a376f7de4f3d0be9e3afaadac09fd4b85a3ccbd","ja":"アタシも役の感想とか教えてもらって、良かったよ！\nこういうのって、次も頑張ろうって気持ちになるよね！","zh":"我也听到了大家对角色的感想之类的，太好啦！\n这种感觉，真的会让人觉得下次也要好好加油呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7d74249b78950539c2b954b8997adfd5f9a6bf5267cc5efac7dae2f484796245","ja":"…………。\nあ、う、うん！　そうだね……！","zh":"…………。\n啊、嗯、嗯！说得也是……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"646ab1fd49a558654494f4592659381954e77e4a8f9ff9b8bb1c67426c5c9826","ja":"……？　育、どうかしたの？\nなんか握手会終わってから、元気なくない……？","zh":"……？育，你怎么了吗？\n握手会结束之后，总觉得你好像没什么精神……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a332aee5866fb27afc7b955bf40f00e9b824d9a42f650a98233317f52df147a8","ja":"えっとね……わたし、もしかしたら……\n嫌われちゃったかも……。","zh":"那个……我、说不定……\n被讨厌了也说不定……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"dd72b1eb7a584bc65dcd880775995423d74c51c72953caaead2628b56a4c8b4a","ja":"えっ！　どうして！？","zh":"诶！　为什么！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"65c522b47f9e830fadd783e3aadf709cba6063f75a361c7fcf5a978f1765e52c","ja":"1時間前。\nとある小さな姉妹との握手中のこと……","zh":"1小时前。\n是在和一对年幼的姐妹握手时发生的事……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"accb152c767b29851db5e10d29f6cdc01cbd2167d170017588ee26edaf8d2b7d","ja":"お姉ちゃんは、イーサンが一番好きなの？\nありがとうございます！　それじゃあ……。","zh":"姐姐最喜欢伊桑吗？\n非常感谢！那么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"140d47a05324fe774ad81b7660591bc8dbe44c62d9a3de00d155d7c02051890a","ja":"「モーガンじゃないが、教えてやる。\nお前は僕の拳を食らって、朝までおねんねだ」","zh":"“我可不是摩根，不过我可以告诉你。\n你挨了我这拳，就给我乖乖睡到大天亮吧”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"8790117cd6bb477b88da2c96d828ae839f1f04d19e05f15f60ee59e8e0065146","ja":"劇のワンシーンを再現してみせた育。\n喜んでくれた姉に対して、妹は……","zh":"重现了剧中一幕的育。\n面对感到开心的姐姐，妹妹却……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a73b0bf6dc1d272843943b18f2ed43fa3a15f73f2dbc375bfafacd2a5e1e15a7","ja":"「わ～～～～ん！　こわいよ～～～～！」","zh":"“哇————！好可怕啊————！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"eca5ecbe34e9e7efa729be59683a205bfc5576f6932a336003f9d173172e0ec1","ja":"えっ……！？　ど、どうしたの！？\nわ、わたし、そんなに怖かった！？","zh":"咦……！？怎、怎么了吗！？\n我、我有那么吓人吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"5c22ad2c1fe2d5567c73ac5523bcf8c0fc9ebf4ce37b24bb122adc080f934e5a","ja":"な、泣かないで。\nほら、一緒に握手しよっ！　ねっ！","zh":"别、别哭呀。\n来，我们握个手吧！好不好！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1062.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e969a49502e7e84dd53f15711a838de83a18fce7567d566d7e40dd2cbf9e32aa","ja":"「やだっ！　こないで～～～～！」","zh":"「不要！别过来～～～～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
